---
description: Propose documented care and harvest-right transfers when a member leaves mid-season.
args: { garden: GardenDossier; change: GardenChange; negotiation: AllocationNegotiation }
returns: string[]
---
List the departing member's active plots, tasks, shared-tool reservations, and harvest rights. Identify a successor only when the successor and affected members have accepted the transfer. Preserve rights and responsibilities as unresolved until a signed agreement binds each item. Never treat departure as forfeiture without the supplied garden rules and acceptance record.
